<title>CANADA: Bombardier starts high speed rail study.</title>
<headline>Bombardier starts high speed rail study.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombardier Inc said it has already begun a pre-feasibility examination of a high-speed rail service between Quebec City, Quebec and Windsor, Ontario, along with five other firms.</p>
<p>The partners include SNC-Lavalin Group Inc, AGRA Industries Ltd,  Groupe Axor Inc,  Ellis-Don Construction Ltd and GEC-Alsthom NV.</p>
<p>-- Lydia Zajc, Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
